usage: analyze_lean_whnf_profile.py [-h] --run RUN --label LABEL
                                    --inputs INPUTS --reference REFERENCE
                                    [--reference-label REFERENCE_LABEL]
                                    --out OUT

Read whole native WHNF captures without launching or changing a verifier.
Terminal totals are process-local and may be inherited across preparation
forks. Missing terminal dumps are censored, not zero. Never compute a GPU
speedup bound.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --run RUN
  --label LABEL
  --inputs INPUTS
  --reference REFERENCE
  --reference-label REFERENCE_LABEL
  --out OUT
